Network playback acceleration
=============================

The Range downloader, CDN resolver, automatic concurrency controller and their
regression fixtures were adapted from lemonteaau/PiliPlus, commit
257807d7ffc72df25e88340c8ee3bcecdb59264b:
https://github.com/lemonteaau/PiliPlus

This PiliPlus-derived implementation remains covered by the repository's
GPL-3.0 license in LICENSE. The referenced Bilibili-thread-ripper algorithms
are MIT licensed; their original notice is preserved in
docs/licenses/bilibili-thread-ripper.txt.
https://github.com/MrTangLuyao/Bilibili-thread-ripper

This fork adds bounded single-CDN selection, bitrate-aware playback buffering,
independent download sessions, and settings that retain the user's manual CDN
selection when BTR is disabled.
